---
<BaseLayout title="Agriculture pipes & fittings | Flowin Pipes & Fittings" description="Explore Flowin agriculture pipes and fittings with verified 2026 catalogue tables.">
  <SiteHeader /><main><div class="wrap product-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Agriculture</span></div>
    <section class="wrap range-hero" aria-labelledby="range-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Product system / 04</span><h1 id="range-title">Agriculture<br />range.</h1></div><div class="range-hero-side"><p>Compare printed pipe lengths and pressure or class columns, then browse matching fittings. All details are source-checked against page 14 of the 2026 catalogue.</p><a class="text-link" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=14" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View agriculture catalogue page <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="wrap range-family-section" aria-labelledby="families-title"><div class="range-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Explore agriculture</span><h2 id="families-title">Pipes and<br />fittings.</h2><p>Printed blank rate cells remain blank. “ISI” is reproduced only as the catalogue’s group label.</p></div><div class="family-card-grid">
      <a class="family-card family-card-featured" href="/products/agriculture/pipes/"><span class="family-number">01 / PIPES</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M26 16v88m20-88v88m28-88v88m20-88v88M20 16h32M20 104h32M68 16h32M68 104h32" /></svg></div><div><h3>Agriculture pipes</h3><p>3 m and 6 m groups with pressure and ISI-labelled class rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
      <a class="family-card" href="/products/agriculture/fittings/"><span class="family-number">02 / FITTINGS</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M42 15h36v31h28v29H78v30H42V75H14V46h28zM47 22h26M47 99h26" /></svg></div><div><h3>Agriculture fittings</h3><p>Elbows, tees, couplers, back flow and RRC couplers.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
    </div></section>
  </main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
